From: eileenthg <40307498+eileenthg@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 23:26:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] Finish mechanical Forge->NeoForge import port; zero
 net.minecraftforge imports remain

- DelightfulItemTagProvider.java: last remaining file, RegistryObject -> DeferredHolder,
  Tags/ExistingFileHelper package renames.
- Cross-checked every real (non-FD-CommonTags/ModTags) Tags.Items.* and Tags.Blocks.*
  reference in the codebase against the actual NeoForge 21.1.219 jar's Tags class and fixed
  4 renamed constants that would otherwise have failed to compile or (worse) silently
  resolved to nothing: STRING -> STRINGS, TOOLS_FISHING_RODS -> TOOLS_FISHING_ROD,
  SHEARS -> TOOLS_SHEAR, SAND/SANDSTONE -> SANDS/SANDSTONE_BLOCKS (WildSalmonberriesBlock,
  CantaloupePlantBlock, DelightfulRecipeProvider, DelightfulBlockTagProvider).

grep -rl "net.minecraftforge" src/main/java now returns nothing. Next: attempt compileJava
and fix whatever the compiler surfaces.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
